    "description": {
      "text": "\tThe low cost of living and virtually zero unemployment rate make poverty and crime relatively rare occurrences. Instead there is a pioneering spirit, a startup-world attitude that anything is attainable with a bit of hard work and frugality.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "\tIn the central building, dozens of workers fill a large cafeteria with several stations serving different types of food. The mood here feels boisterous and energetic, bolstered further by the local Remembrance Day celebrations. Locals and tourists take turns downing as many beers as possible as their friends shout Alpha Wars folk songs.",
      "toDisplay": [
        "\"days since year start\" > 35",
        "\"days since year start\" < 55"
      ]
    },
