    "description": {
      "text": "\tCenturies ago Mainsail was home to pirates of the old-fashioned variety, fleets of motor boats or even old-fashioned sailing vessels that would launch raids against the city-ships.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "\tFew goods are produced here; most of the people rich enough to live on Mainsail are connected with interplanetary corporations whose physical business takes place elsewhere.",
